#: d3a43375ee9e42bf8a55d1e7468de606 of
#: sds.advanced.interfaces.AbstractLRUCache.put:3
msgid ""
"If *key* already exists its value is updated and it is marked as most "
"recently used. If the cache is at capacity, the least recently used entry"
" is evicted before insertion."
msgstr ""

#: 01b3700c591d45b2937eb1d0953f0472 of
